hint: If head is None or head.next is None, return head. Walk `tail` to the last node, counting n from 1.
hint: `tail.next = head` makes a circle. Move `tail = tail.next` `n - k % n` times.
hint: `head = tail.next`, then `tail.next = None`, and return head.
